ck</surname><given-names>GG</given-names></name><name><surname>Davidson</surname><given-names>MK</given-names></name><name><surname>Wahls</surname><given-names>WP</given-names></name></person-group><year>2002</year><article-title>Distinct functions of <named-content content-type="genus-species">S. pombe</named-content> Rec12 (Spo11) protein and Rec12-dependent crossover recombination (chiasmata) in meiosis I; and a requirement for Rec12 in meiosis II</article-title><source>Cell Chromosome</source><volume>1</volume><fpage>1</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12437782</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050324-b012"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Keeney</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Kleckner</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name></person-group><year>1995</year><article-title>Covalent protein-DNA complexes at the 5' strand termini of meiosis-specific double-strand breaks in yeast</article-title><source>Proc Natl Acad Sci U S A</source><volume>92</volume><fpage>11274</fpage><lpage>11278</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7479978</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050324-b013"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Neale</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Pan</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Keeney</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Endonucleolytic processing of covalent protein-linked DNA double-strand breaks</article-title><source>Nature</source><volume>436</volume><fpage>1053</fpage><lpage>1057</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16107854</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pbio-0050324-b014"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Sun</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Treco</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Szostak</su